GOAL: a polished, single-screen 3-state UI: (1) choose a synthetic patient (and optionally paste raw notes) → (2) generating (skeletons) → (3) the pre-visit briefing. Simple but VISUALLY VERY PLEASING, matching the aesthetic of cursor.com/home: deep near-black background, crisp off-white type, subtle hairline borders, lots of breathing room, a soft radial gradient glow behind the header, rounded-2xl cards, monospace for small labels/badges. Tasteful, minimal, premium. NOT flashy.

EXACT COLOR/AESTHETIC TOKENS (use these via CSS variables in globals.css and Tailwind arbitrary values):
