- font: system UI sans for body (-apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Inter, sans-serif); ui-monospace/SFMono for labels & badges.

FILES TO CREATE:
1. app/globals.css — start with `@import "tailwindcss";` then define the CSS variables above on :root, set body background/color/font, add a `.glow` helper (a blurred radial gradient using the accent), and `@media print` rules that hide everything except the briefing (.print-area) for a clean printout. Tailwind v4 — no tailwind.config needed.
