- priority badges: high → text #fca5a5 on rgba(248,113,113,0.10) border rgba(248,113,113,0.25); med → text #fcd34d on rgba(251,191,36,0.10); low → text #93c5fd on rgba(96,165,250,0.10).
- flag category badges: safety → red palette (as high); contradiction → amber (as med); missing-info → blue (as low); stale → muted grey (#a1a1aa on rgba(161,161,170,0.10)).
